*** Epi Info AI matched case-control command tour
*** Dataset: case-control-database-example.xlsx (130 records; 65 matched pairs)
*** The Epi Info 7 guide frames this as chicken consumption and illness.
*** QUALITY and FREQ expose missing/non-binary AnyChkn values before MATCH.
*** MATCH retains 57 analyzable pairs and reports eight excluded pairs.
*** Browser-verified candidate; historical desktop field-user comparison pending.
*** The final LOGISTIC command demonstrates adjusted conditional regression.
*** Age is illustrative only; the original matching protocol was not recovered.
*** Run Commands executes all nine commands in source order and retains each output.

EPIAI QUALITY *

LIST uid matched_pairs caco age anychkn

FREQ caco

FREQ matched_pairs

FREQ anychkn

MEANS age

TABLES anychkn caco

MATCH anychkn caco MATCHVAR=matched_pairs

LOGISTIC caco = anychkn age MATCHVAR=matched_pairs TITLETEXT="Illustrative chicken exposure model adjusted for age"
